      `they build on the existing procedures for designation in accordance with the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they ensure compliance with the requirements relating to notified bodies both in accordance with this Regulation and the relevant Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 28(8) fourth subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment procedure are shaped as required` MEANS
    `Art 28 to 39 the maybe-answer when the group applies` `the date asked`
        (CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as enacted. NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph was inserted by the Omnibus and is not in the text as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN JUST (`Art 28(8) as amended fourth subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment procedure are shaped as required` `the single application and the unified assessment procedure avoid any unnecessary duplications` `they build on the existing procedures for designation in accordance with the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` `they ensure compliance with the requirements relating to notified bodies both in accordance with this Regulation and the relevant Union harmonisation legislation`))  -- VERSION as amended

GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the notifying authority has been designated pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Member State designates another notifying authority for this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 28(9) the notifying authority is also the notifying authority for the single application and unified assessment procedure` MEANS
    `Art 28 to 39 the maybe-answer when the group applies` `the date asked`
        (CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as enacted. NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph was inserted by the Omnibus and is not in the text as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN `Art 28(9) as amended the notifying authority is also the notifying authority for the single application and unified assessment procedure` `the notifying authority has been designated pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I` `the Member State designates another notifying authority for this Regulation`)  -- VERSION as amended

-- The duty of paragraph 8 first subparagraph as a regulative rule (as amended only; before 27 July 2026 nothing is owed).
-- No time limit and no consequence is stated, so no trace can show it breached.
-- src:540 | 8. Notifying authorities designated pursuant to this Regulation that are responsible for AI systems covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I shall ensure that the conformity assessment body that applies for designation both pursuant to this Regulation and the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I is provided with the possibility to submit a single application and undergoes a unified assessment procedure to be designated pursuant to this Regulation and Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I, where the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides for such single application and unified assessment procedure. To that end, notifying authorities designated pursuant to this Regulation and those designated pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I shall cooperate in their assessments.
-- VERSION as amended
@ref Art 28(8) first subparagraph (src:540)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 28 party` `Art 28 act`
`Art 28(8) the duty of the notifying authority to ensure the single application and the unified assessment` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed before Chapter III Section 4 applies
    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN FULFILLED  -- VERSION as enacted: paragraph 8 is not in the text as enacted, so nothing is owed
         WHEN `as amended` THEN            -- VERSION as amended
             PARTY `Art 28 notifying authority`
             MUST `Art 28(8) ensure the single application and the unified assessment procedure`
             HENCE FULFILLED
